        <item>
            <title>2.36.0</title>
            <pubDate>Mon, 14 Sep 2026 19:53:55 +0900</pubDate>
            <link>https://github.com/Saqoosha/Canopy</link>
            <sparkle:version>122</sparkle:version>
            <sparkle:shortVersionString>2.36.0</sparkle:shortVersionString>
            <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>15.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
            <sparkle:hardwareRequirements>arm64</sparkle:hardwareRequirements>
            <description sparkle:format="markdown"><![CDATA[### Improvements

- **Live sessions open faster on iPhone.** A phone attached to a session now receives only the last 30 turns you typed instead of the whole conversation, so a long session replays in a fraction of the bytes and draws much sooner. Canopy on the Mac is unaffected and still shows everything.
- **The phone can cache the page it loads.** Canopy now tells the phone which Claude Code extension version it runs, so Canopy Mobile (TestFlight build from today onward) keeps the 8 MB of page assets on the device and skips downloading them on every attach.
]]></description>
